 "claims": [
  {
   "page": 147,
   "claim": "Illustrates more than any other fugue Bach's skill in building a large structure from small figures"
  },
  {
   "page": 147,
   "claim": "Exposition does not sound as ending at 17 because harmony suggests III"
  },
  {
   "page": 147,
   "claim": "Five-note rising steps of 18-19 and chromatic falling steps of 47-48 foreshadow the second subject"
  },
  {
